/-- 35:P9, 35:C18, 35:X12 — the vector nonet on the PDG masses: `(2M_K* − M_ρ − M_φ)/(M_ρ + M_φ)` in `(−0.0042, −0.0041)`;
the predicted `K* = (M_ρ + M_φ)/2 = 897.36` within `0.5 %`, `ω = ρ` within `1 %`; the strange increment `122.1`. -/
